.8 14.7l6.2 6.3 6.2-6.3c.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7c-.2-.2-.4-.3-.7-.3h-11c-.3 0-.5.1-.7.3-.2.2-.3.5-.3.7s.1.5.3.7z\"/></svg></span></span></span></a></span></div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 eztoc-toggle-hide-by-default' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/#Personnel\" >Personnel</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/#Tracklisting\" >Tracklisting</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/2/#In_the_studio\" >In the studio</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/3/#Innovations\" >Innovations</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/4/#The_medley\" >The medley</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/4/#The_title\" >The title</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7\" href=\"#The_cover_artwork\" >The cover artwork</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8\" href=\"#Paul_is_dead\" >\u2019Paul is dead&#8217;</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/6/#The_legacy\" >The legacy</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/6/#Chart_success\" >Chart success</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-11\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/6/#SomethingCome_Together\" >Something/Come Together</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"The_cover_artwork\"></span>The cover artwork<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2><p><em>Abbey Road</em> was unique among The Beatles&#8217; albums to feature neither the group&#8217;s name nor the title on its front cover. The four members were pictured walking away from EMI Studios \u2013 a symbolic gesture given the thousands of hours spent inside there since 1962.</p><p>The photography was taken by Iain Macmillan on <a href=\"/1969/08/08/the-abbey-road-cover-photography-session/\">8 August 1969</a>. A freelance photographer, Macmillan was a friend to <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a> and <a href=\"/people/yoko-ono/\">Yoko Ono</a>; he died in May 2006.</p><p>The session began at 11.35am. Macmillan positioned a stepladder in the middle of Abbey Road, and quickly took six photographs using his Hasselblad camera while a policeman stopped traffic from passing. He used a 50mm wide-angle lens, set at aperture f22 at 1/500 seconds.</p><div data-carousel-extra='{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/&quot;}' id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-28 gallery-columns-2 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/miscellany/abbey-road-empty-690808/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTM0IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzNCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"134\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey-road-empty-690808-200x134.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Abbey Road, taken on the morning of the album cover shoot, 8 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey-road-empty-690808-200x134.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey-road-empty-690808-580x390.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey-road-empty-690808.jpg 717w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"11090\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/miscellany/abbey-road-empty-690808/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey-road-empty-690808.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"717,482\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Abbey Road, taken on the morning of The Beatles&amp;#8217; album cover shoot, 8 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey-road-empty-690808.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690808_abbey-road-sketch/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxODQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTg0IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"184\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road-sketch-184x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Sketch for the Abbey Road album cover photo shoot, 8 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road-sketch-184x200.jpg 184w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road-sketch.jpg 401w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 184px) 100vw, 184px\" data-attachment-id=\"8971\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690808_abbey-road-sketch/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road-sketch.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"401,437\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Sketch for the Abbey Road album cover photo shoot, 8 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road-sketch.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><p>In three of the pictures The Beatles were walking away from the studio; in the remainder they walked from right to left. In each of the shots the order was John Lennon, <a href=\"/people/ringo-starr/\">Ringo Starr</a>, <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a>, and <a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George Harrison</a>.</p><div data-carousel-extra='{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/&quot;}' id='gallery-2' class='gallery galleryid-28 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-abbey-road_01/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_01-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Picture one from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_01-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_01-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_01-960x960.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_01-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_01-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_01.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"70060\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-abbey-road_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,1000\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Picture one from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_01-960x960.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-abbey-road_02/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_02-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Picture two from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_02-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_02-580x574.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_02-960x950.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_02-768x760.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_02-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_02.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"70061\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-abbey-road_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,990\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Picture two from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_02-960x950.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-abbey-road_03/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Picture three from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03-960x958.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03-768x766.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"70062\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-abbey-road_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,998\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Picture three from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03-960x958.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-abbey-road_04/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Picture four from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04-578x580.jpg 578w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04-957x960.jpg 957w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04-768x770.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04.jpg 997w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"70063\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-abbey-road_04/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"997,1000\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Picture four from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04-957x960.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/abbey_road/'><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey_road-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Abbey Road album artwork\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey_road-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey_road-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey_road-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey_road.jpg 721w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9046\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/abbey_road/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey_road.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"721,721\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"2\" data-image-title=\"Abbey Road album artwork\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey_road.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-abbey-road_06/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Picture six from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06-580x576.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06-960x953.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06-768x763.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"70064\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-abbey-road_06/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,993\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Picture six from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06-960x953.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><p>During shots 1, 2, 3, 4 and 6 the group were walking out of step. However, the fifth shot was perfect, and was selected by Paul McCartney for the album.</p><p>In the background an American tourist, Paul Cole, was pictured standing next to a police van. Cole was unaware he was pictured on a Beatles album cover until some time later. The Volkswagen Beetle car which was parked on the other side of the road was sold at auction in 1986 for \u00a32,530, and is currently on display at the Autostadt museum in Wolfsburg, Germany.</p><div data-carousel-extra='{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/&quot;}' id='gallery-3' class='gallery galleryid-28 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690808_abbey-road_03/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTU2IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE1NiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIv