ta:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMzMiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTMzIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"133\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_01-133x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles prepare for the Abbey Road album cover photo shoot, 8 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_01-133x200.jpg 133w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_01.jpg 331w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 133px) 100vw, 133px\" data-attachment-id=\"8970\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690808_abbey-road_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"331,496\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles prepare for the Abbey Road album cover photo shoot, 8 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_01.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690808_abbey-road_07/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTM5IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzOSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"139\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_07-200x139.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles crossing Abbey Road, 8 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_07-200x139.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_07-580x403.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_07-960x666.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_07-768x533.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_07.jpg 1131w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"11291\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690808_abbey-road_07/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_07.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1131,785\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles crossing Abbey Road, 8 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_07-960x666.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690808_abbey-road_02/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTU5IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE1OSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"159\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_02-200x159.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles crossing Abbey Road, 8 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_02-200x159.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_02-580x461.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_02-960x763.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_02-768x611.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_02.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"11284\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690808_abbey-road_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,795\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles crossing Abbey Road, 8 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690808_abbey-road_02-960x763.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Paul_is_dead\"></span>\u2019Paul is dead&#8217;<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2><p><a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> wore sandals for the first two shots taken by Iain Macmillan, but afterwards took them off and walked barefoot. This action became one of the &#8216;clues&#8217; in the <a href=\"/features/paul-is-dead/\">Paul Is Dead myth</a>, which began in September 1969.</p><p>There were said to be three clues on the front cover:</p><ul><li>The order in which The Beatles walked was said to make reference to a funeral procession, with <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a> dressed all in white as a priest; <a href=\"/people/ringo-starr/\">Ringo Starr</a> in a black suit as an undertaker; McCartney being barefoot, as many corpses would have been buried; and <a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George Harrison</a> following as a gravedigger. McCartney was also out of step with the others, with his eyes closed.</li><li>McCartney was pictured holding a cigarette with his right hand. However, it was well known that he was left-handed, suggesting that an impostor was in his place.</li><li>A Volkswagen Beetle car in the background has the numberplate LMW 28IF. LMW was taken to mean &#8216;<a href=\"/people/linda-mccartney/\">Linda McCartney</a> weeps&#8217;, and 28IF was interpreted as referring to Paul&#8217;s age if he had lived. However, at the time of <em>Abbey Road</em>\u2019s release in 1969 he would have been 27, rather than 28.</li></ul><p>Furthermore, on the back cover a ghostly face, fancifully believed by some to be the Grim Reaper, is cast by a shadow onto the wall next to The Beatles&#8217; name.</p><div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/2/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/3/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">3</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/4/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">4</span></a> <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">5</span></span> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/abbey-road/6/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">6</span></a></div>",
